  "summary": "<two sentences for the upload description>",
  "_help": "See STANDARDS.md section 11. Visual types: title, bullets (items, reveal), text (body, pre), table (columns, rows), code (file, highlight, output or error, note, hidden_text), prompt (label, prompt, check), pause (question, seconds), end. Delete this key.",
